        <section id="overview" class="py-3">
            <h2 class="pipe">Asphalt Paving, Structural Masonry & Excavation in Bolton, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> delivers comprehensive site preparation, commercial paving, and custom hardscape construction for estate owners and agricultural properties in <strong>Bolton, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in the rolling hills of Worcester County, Bolton properties frequently encounter dense glacial till, subsurface ledge rock, and steep slope runoff challenges. Heavy winter frost and spring thaw cycles cause severe lateral earth pressure on unreinforced stone walls and subgrade shifting underneath asphalt driveways. S. Phaneuf & Associates engineers every project with heavy equipment excavation, deep gravel drainage bases, and dense-graded bituminous concrete to ensure long-term structural resilience across Bolton's terrain.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="area-projects" class="py-3">
            <h2 class="pipe">Reliable Paving & Site Work Across Bolton</h2>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates manages multi-acre site clearing, foundation digging, asphalt driveway paving, and fieldstone masonry throughout Bolton. In <strong>Bolton Center</strong>, crews complete historic restoration masonry, paver walkways, and asphalt resurfacing along the Route 117 corridor near the Bolton Center Historic District, the historic Bolton Town House (1853), and the Tudor Revival Bolton Public Library. Across the <strong>Nashoba Valley / Route 117 Corridor</strong>, teams execute heavy excavation, utility trenching, and commercial roadway paving for agricultural properties and estates surrounding Nashoba Valley Winery and local fruit orchards. S. Phaneuf & Associates brings specialized heavy machinery to manage Bolton's complex grade changes.</p>
        </section>

